info
# Issue #1859: once-per-supervisor-start publication of the notify sink the
# daemon actually resolved (enabled / sink / cwd-anchored absolute digest
# path). The heartbeat reads the latest row to answer "what is the daemon
# writing to" instead of re-deriving config from the script's own checkout.
# Emitted with level="warning" explicitly when the resolution is the
# incoherent enabled + sink=file + empty file_path combination; info is the
# registry default for the healthy shapes.
